# Locally minted TLS material for the HTTP/2 listener.
#
# `proxy.mjs` mints a `*.localhost` certificate here on first run because
# browsers negotiate HTTP/2 over TLS only, and without HTTP/2 Studio exhausts
# Chromium's six-connection budget and no document pane ever loads
# (`tlsMaterial.mjs` has the measurement and the ladder).
#
# NEVER COMMITTED. It is a private key, it is machine-local, and a committed one
# would be a key every clone of this repository shares. Deleting this directory
# is always safe: the next start mints another.
.tls/
